{
  "dialogue": [
    {
      "start": [
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "Hello my little hearts! Etsukokoro, menhera streamer, here!",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "Today, I'm doing a Q&A. Superchats get priority! And I've got a surprise",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "I basically got into stardom by just cutting myself on stream...",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "So for every $100 donation, I'm gonna cut myself!!!!",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "...So every $100 is gonna be a cut on my arm this stream! Kyun~!",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [
            {
              "name": "notif",
              "args": [
                "anaiva11",
                "$100",
                "cut urself onegai shimasu"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "A $100 superchat already?!",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "Cut",
              "event": {
                "name": "set_branch",
                "args": [
                  "cut1"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "Don't cut",
              "event": {
