                "args": [
                  "game_over"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cut1": [
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "Okay!",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "Itee... That one was a little more deeper than I intended... heh...",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "Feels good seeing the blood drip down my arm...",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "You guys are probably getting off to this aren't you? Pervs...",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [
            {
              "name": "set_branch",
              "args": [
                "stream1"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "choices": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "stream1": [
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "But that's okay!! As long as you stay a loyal viewer!!",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [
            {
              "name": "notif",
              "args": [
                "andydandy15",
                "$25",
                "Why'd u become a streamer?"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "Good question!!",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "'Cause loneliness is agonizing!!",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "As a child, my parents were always away on business trips.",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "They'd never have time for me...",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "Whenever they were free, they'd say they were too tired to even talk with me...",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "And whenever I cried, they just told me I'm too needy and spoiled!",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "I guess I can't really blame them...",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "I was born in the aftermath of the Suzuki Crisis, so things were really tough economically and they had to work their assess off for a feasible living...",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "But still...",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "And I never really had any friends either, barely anybody at school or in my neighborhood wanted to hang out with me...",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "And in the rare times someone would talk with me and try to be my friend, they'd end up leaving me!",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "Telling me I'm too weird and clingy!",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "The loneliness made me want to kill myself.",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "I spent my days watching streamers to distract myself from the pain of loneliness",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "And even though it took me a while, 'cause I'm retarded or something, I finally realized the solution to my loneliness!",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "Becoming a streamer myself!",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "I could be the one getting all that love and attention!",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "And money too! Maybe I can stop having to depend on an allowance from my parents!!",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "Every single viewer makes me happy!",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [
            {
              "name": "notif",
              "args": [
                "ProjectAlice",
                "$100",
                "Cut yourself more",
                "stupid foid."
              ]
            }
          ],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "That's a little mean...",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "But...",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": [
            {
              "text": "Cut",
              "event": {
                "name": "set_branch",
                "args": [
                  "cut2"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "Don't cut",
              "event": {
