    {
      "stream2": [
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "Haaaaaaa... feels ecstatic cutting in front of so many people...",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [
            {
              "name": "notif",
              "args": [
                "$50",
                "kuronekosan",
                "what's your favorite videogame?"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "I've always liked videogames where the protag can die in several ways.",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "Whenever I'd get overwhelmed, I would play those games just to see the protag die over and over again.",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "Neck-breaking, blown-into-smithereens-ing, shot-in-the-heart-ing, and more.",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "I could do that too... Just end it all...",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "I live quite a few stories high... it'd all be so quick",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "But I've endured! And with the ecstasy of strangers' attention, I don't need to die anymore!",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "I really like games with sexy female protags too!",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "Not 'cause I'd self-insert myself into them, and imagine I'm a sexy girl too, but cause they'd die!",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "I can't get to be all athletic and hot like, lets say, Lara Croft, so in trade, she gets to die!",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "Again and again!!!",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "I'd make her drown on purpose.",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "Just to watch her gasp for air!",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [
