    {
      "stream3": [
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "Yeah, I'm single!",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "Love's more than a drug to me, it's more like oxygen... I depend on it.",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "If there was liquid love, I'd inject so much of it into me.",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "I did have a boyfriend, once.",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "I thought he was such a nice guy at first.",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "I explained that I'm really mentally ill, and he stayed anyway.",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "That attention is more important than even eating to me, and I'd be annoyingly clingy.",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "It was all fine at the start, but...",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "As time went on, he'd respond less frequently, and give more dryer responses.",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "And I'd worry that I was an annoyance, a burden to him.",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "The thoughts of being hated by the person I loved so dearly got more and more intense, I was going insane.",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "I distracted myself from these thoughts by cutting myself all the time.",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "I wanted him to understand, to feel the pain I did, I even showed him my scars, how much I cut myself over him.",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "I showed how much I broke down over him, how much I loved him, how much I hated the thought of him hating me.",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "My life revolved around him, he was my everything!!!",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "But I guess I was just disposable to him...",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "Because he left me anyway.",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "It's funny, he knew how I was like, 'cause I told him and stuff, and yet he left me and was, in the end, far from accomodating.",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "He said it was fine, but I guess not.",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "I wonder if he wanted me to suffer.",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "It took me so long to move on. And I felt like I deserved all the pain.",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "The question wasn't if I deserved it, but what I did to deserve it; what did I do that made everything go so downhill.",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [],
          "choices": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Etsuko",
          "text": "I'm so surprised I didn't end up killing myself over him. I'm somehow still here after all that I went through.",
          "attrs": [],
          "events": [
            {
              "name": "notif",
              "args": [
                "madonanami",
                "$1000",
                "cut yourself 10 times ^o^"
              ]
